<!--62158FA877E24D709EDD472862F376BB-->  <NAME><![CDATA[Requeue Failed Vector Events]]></NAME>
<!--62158FA877E24D709EDD472862F376BB-->  <DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[Puts failed indexing events back in the queue.]]></DESCRIPTION>
<!--62158FA877E24D709EDD472862F376BB-->  <HELP><![CDATA[Failed events are never retried on their own, because redelivering them on a timer would spend provider calls reproducing the same failure. Run this once the provider or source configuration is corrected. The attempt counter is reset, so the events get a full budget again. Read the Last Error column of the Outbox Monitor window first to see what broke.]]></HELP>
